{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:Observations.HopfDiquark","@type":"LeanModule","name":"Observations.HopfDiquark","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":27,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.borromean_dominates_diquark","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.borromean_dominates_diquark","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hopf-diquark.lean#L110-L115","doc":"At q = 1.1097, Borromean binding vastly exceeds diquark binding. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.diquark_binding_per_baryon","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.diquark_binding_per_baryon","kind":"def","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hopf-diquark.lean#L104-L108","doc":"Hopf diquark binding per baryon number.\nThree diquark pairs per two baryon-number units. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.borromean_binding_per_baryon","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.borromean_binding_per_baryon","kind":"def","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hopf-diquark.lean#L98-L102","doc":"Borromean binding per baryon number at substrate parameter q.\nUses the topological mass formula with V_B = 7.32772. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.cfl_gap_approx","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.cfl_gap_approx","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hopf-diquark.lean#L91-L96","doc":"At q = 1.1097, the CFL gap is approximately 2.011 Skein units. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.cfl_gap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.cfl_gap","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hopf-diquark.lean#L87-L89","doc":"The CFL gap: energy to break a single Hopf diquark. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.hopf_crossing_energy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.hopf_crossing_energy","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hopf-diquark.lean#L81-L85","doc":"Crossing energy of the Hopf link at substrate parameter q.\nThe Hopf link T_{2,2} has braid word σ₁², contributing\n2 positive crossings. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.hopf_link_volume","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.hopf_link_volume","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hopf-diquark.lean#L76-L79","doc":"Hopf link volume is zero (torus link, not hyperbolic). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.hopf_linking_number","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.hopf_linking_number","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hopf-diquark.lean#L72-L74","doc":"Linking number of the Hopf link: +1 for the canonical orientation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HopfDiquark.spectatorColor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HopfDiquark.spectatorColor","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hopf-diquark.lean#L65-L70","doc":"The spectator color: the tube not participating in the diquark. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HopfDiquark.flavor_distinct","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HopfDiquark.flavor_distinct","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hopf-diquark.lean#L63-L63","doc":"Flavors must be distinct (most attractive channel) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HopfDiquark.color_distinct","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HopfDiquark.color_distinct","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hopf-diquark.lean#L61-L61","doc":"Colors must be distinct (antisymmetric pairing) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HopfDiquark.color₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HopfDiquark.color₂","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hopf-diquark.lean#L59-L59","doc":"Second quark color tube ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HopfDiquark.color₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HopfDiquark.color₁","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hopf-diquark.lean#L57-L57","doc":"First quark color tube ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HopfDiquark.flavor₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HopfDiquark.flavor₂","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hopf-diquark.lean#L55-L55","d